tc_docbr+'- '+str_attr_SRDamage+' - unit is under "Damage Resistance Sphere" effect; it takes half damage and resist to "pain state" effect;'
tc_docbr+'- '+str_attr_SDDamage+' - unit is under "Double Damage Sphere" effect; it deals double damage;'
tc_docbr+'- '+str_attr_STurbo  +' - unit is under "Turbo Sphere" effect; its movement, attack, regeneration, production, construction and reloading speeds are doubled.'
