tc_docbr
tc_orange+'PAIN STATE'+tc_default+tc_doccpt
tc_docbr
'Some units have "Pain State" - it is a 1-second stun state after a certain number of damage hits. During the "Pain State" unit can`t attack or move. "Pain State" is accompanied by a special sound and unit animation.'
tc_docbr
tc_docbr
tc_orange+'VETERAN SYSTEM'+tc_default+tc_doccpt
tc_docbr
'All combat units gain combat experience and increase their level. All units spawn at level 1 and can be upgraded to level 4. With each new level, the unit increases its damage, armor, and pain threshold.'
'The time in combat required to reach the next level varies for each type of unit(see "'+str_help_UnitsInfo+'" section).'
tc_docbr
tc_docbr
tc_orange+'DAMAGE CALCULATION SEQUENCE'+tc_default+tc_doccpt
tc_docbr
'1) The game takes the attacking unit`s base damage and adds bonuses from upgrades and veteran level;'
tc_docbr+'2) Special effects of the attacking unit that affect its damage amount are applied ("'+str_attr_heroic+'" attribute and "'+str_attr_SDDamage+'" effect);'
tc_docbr+'3) A damage modifier for the attacking unit is applied to the resulting value;'
tc_docbr+'4) Special effects reducing the received damage by the target unit are applied ("'+str_attr_heroic+'" attribute and "'+str_attr_SRDamage+'" effect);'
tc_docbr+'5) The armor of the target unit is calculated (bonuses from upgrades and its veteran level are summed up) and subtracted from the inflicted damage; if the damage drops below 1, it is raised to 1;'
tc_docbr+'6) The target unit receives the final calculated damage.'
tc_docbr+'Special cases:'
tc_docbr+'- If the unit is a building under construction, steps 4 and 5 are skipped;'
tc_docbr+'- Damage dealt by the "Decay Aura" effect also ignores points 4 and 5;'
tc_docbr+'- Units with '+str_attr_building+' or '+str_attr_mech+' attribute are immune to splash damage.'
tc_docbr
tc_docbr
tc_orange+'OTHER'+tc_default+tc_doccpt
tc_docbr
'If a player loses all his builders - all his units revealed on the map.'
tc_docbr
tc_docbr+'Unit hits regeneration period is 1 second.'

